      "text": "Regeneration is the ability to replace lost or damaged body parts — from complete whole-body reconstruction to the limited compensatory growth mammals manage. The field maps a spectrum from near-unlimited biological \"source code\" re-execution to the scar-forming default of the mammalian immune response."
